/*
  ============================================================
  CODE 3 MX7000 - GIGA DISPLAY CONTROLLER
  Arduino GIGA R1 WiFi + GIGA Display Shield
  ============================================================

  GIGA <-> NANO ESP32 UART
  -----------------------
  GIGA D1 TX  -> Nano D12 RX
  GIGA D0 RX  <- Nano D13 TX
  GIGA GND    -> Nano GND
  Baud: 38400

  ============================================================
  LIGHTBAR BUTTON COLORS
  ============================================================

  DARK
    Inactive

  BLUE
    Physical switch active

  FLASHING BLUE
    Physical switch active but in startup hold

  FLASHING PURPLE
    GIGA command is waiting for final confirmation

  SOLID PURPLE
    GIGA command failed to reach confirmation after 30 seconds

  GREEN
    GIGA START command confirmed by Mega

  ============================================================
  COMMAND RETRY BEHAVIOR
  ============================================================

  0 sec   Send command
          Flash purple

  5 sec   Retry

  10 sec  Retry

  15 sec  Retry

  20 sec  Retry

  25 sec  Retry

  30 sec  Give up
          Solid purple

  A CONFIRMED response at any point immediately ends retries.

  ============================================================
*/


